## 语法风格对照

| 风格 | 语法 | 示例 | 平台 |
|------|------|------|------|
| Google Curly (lower) | `{lowercase}` | `{campaignid}` | Google Ads, 百度, 360, 知乎, 微博 |
| Google Curly (Pascal) | `{PascalCase}` | `{CampaignId}` | Bing Ads |
| Google Curly (camel) | `{camelCase}` | `{planId}` | UC |
| Google Curly (snake) | `{snake_case}` | `{campaign_id}` | Yandex |
| Meta Mustache | `{{dot.path}}` | `{{campaign.id}}` | Meta, Snap, Pinterest, Reddit, X, LinkedIn |
| ByteDance Macro | `__UPPER__` | `__CAMPAIGN_ID__` | TikTok, 抖音, 广点通, 快手 |
| Naver | `n_field` | `n_campaign` | Naver |

## URL 结构规范

```
https://{domain}/{page_path}?sourceId={id}&el={el}&sec={sec}&utm_source={src}&utm_medium={med}&utm_campaign={camp}[&utm_term={term}][&utm_content={content}][&{macro1}={val1}&{macro2}={val2}...]
```

- Layer 1（sourceId/el/sec）在前
- Layer 2（UTM）居中
- Layer 3（平台宏）在后
- 参数按字母序排列（同层内）

## 常见场景 URL 示例

### Google Ads 搜索广告

```
https://lovart.ai/tools/seedance?sourceId=910001&el=cta_hero&sec=hero&utm_source=google&utm_medium=cpc&utm_campaign=seedance-2.0&utm_term=seedance_group&utm_content=variant_a&adgroupid={adgroupid}&campaignid={campaignid}&creative={creative}&device={device}&keyword={keyword}&matchtype={matchtype}&network={network}&targetid={targetid}
```

### Meta 信息流广告

```
https://lovart.ai/tools/seedance?sourceId=910001&el=cta_hero&sec=hero&utm_source=meta&utm_medium=social&utm_campaign=seedance-2.0&utm_content=variant_a&ad_id={{ad.id}}&adset_id={{adset.id}}&campaign_id={{campaign.id}}&placement={{placement}}
```

### 广点通投放

```
https://lovart.ai/tools/seedance?sourceId=910001&el=cta_hero&utm_source=gdt&utm_medium=cpa&utm_campaign=seedance-2.0&campaign_id=__CAMPAIGN_ID__&adgroup_id=__ADGROUP_ID__&creative_id=__CREATIVE_ID__&device=__DEVICE_TYPE__&site_set=__SITE_SET__
```

### 内容分发（知乎自然分发）

```
https://lovart.ai/blog/ai-video-tools?sourceId=0&el=link_inline&utm_source=zhihu_organic&utm_medium=syndication&utm_campaign=offsite_ai-video-tools
```
